    "status": "blocked-guest-side",
    "rust": "Rust oracle check --json emits full spans (code/key/range.line:col/byte); frozen corpus diagnostic_ids are a coarse classification (regex E[0-9]{4} over plain check text, else LEXICAL) and carry no span.",
    "guest": "Guest refusal identity is a bare ERR:E-SH-IR-* code with no span (runner outcome class domain-error). No guest-side span evidence exists.",
    "consequence": "True (verdict, id, span) triple parity is NOT reachable with current evidence. This artifact registers (rust_code <-> guest_code) equivalence classes only; span parity is reported as a residual gap, not asserted."
  },
